#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:44
msgid "Governed AI abilities for WordPress: schema-bounded recommendations, read-only context and preview helpers, and review-gated external applies with server-side attribution and drift-safe undo. AI proposes; WordPress approves."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:103
msgid "Preview block recommendation signatures"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:104
msgid "Resolve the apply-context signature for a block recommendation request without invoking the AI Connector. Read-only preflight for the Abilities Explorer and external MCP clients."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:108
msgid "Preview navigation recommendation signatures"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:109
msgid "Resolve the review-context signature for a navigation recommendation request without invoking the AI Connector. Read-only preflight for the Abilities Explorer and external MCP clients."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:113
msgid "Preview style recommendation signatures"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:114
msgid "Resolve the review and apply context signatures for a Global Styles or Style Book recommendation request without invoking the AI Connector. Read-only preflight for the Abilities Explorer and external MCP clients."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:118
msgid "Preview template recommendation signatures"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:119
msgid "Resolve the review and apply context signatures for a template recommendation request without invoking the AI Connector. Read-only preflight for the Abilities Explorer and external MCP clients."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:123
msgid "Preview template-part recommendation signatures"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:124
msgid "Resolve the review and apply context signatures for a template-part recommendation request without invoking the AI Connector. Read-only preflight for the Abilities Explorer and external MCP clients."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:128
msgid "Preview post-blocks recommendation signatures"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:129
msgid "Resolve the review and apply context signatures for a post-blocks recommendation request without invoking the AI Connector. Read-only preflight for the Abilities Explorer and external MCP clients."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:157
msgid "Get block recommendations"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:158
msgid "Suggest attribute and style changes for a block using theme design tokens. Responses are bounded by the block operation schema and execution contract, classified for inline or review-gated apply, and carry freshness signatures so a stale editing context cannot apply."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:162
msgid "Recommend editorial content"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:163
msgid "Draft, edit, or critique blog posts, essays, and site copy in Henry Perkins's voice. Editorial-only by contract: schema-bounded text output with no apply path, so it never mutates site content."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:167
msgid "Recommend patterns"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:168
msgid "Rank registered and synced block patterns for the current editing context. Read-only ranking with explained reasons: pattern insertion stays native Gutenberg behavior, and Flavor Agent owns no pattern apply or undo."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:172
msgid "Recommend navigation structure"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:173
msgid "Suggest navigation menu structure, overlay behavior, and organization. Advisory-only by contract: schema-bounded guidance with review-context signatures and no navigation apply path in this release."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:177
msgid "Recommend site styles"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:178
msgid "Suggest theme-safe style changes and theme style variations for supported Site Editor style surfaces. Operations are bounded to validated theme.json paths with WCAG AA contrast checks, reviewed before apply, and recorded server-side with drift-checked undo."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:182
msgid "Recommend template structure"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:183
msgid "Suggest template-part arrangements and patterns for a template type. Operations come from a bounded template-operation vocabulary, are previewed and reviewed before deterministic apply, and recorded server-side with drift-checked undo."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:187
msgid "Recommend template-part structure"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:188
msgid "Suggest focused structural improvements and patterns for a single template part. Operations come from a bounded template-part operation vocabulary, are previewed and reviewed before deterministic apply, and recorded server-side with drift-checked undo."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:192
msgid "Recommend post content structure"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:193
msgid "Suggest focused structural improvements and patterns for a single post or page document. Operations come from the bounded structural-operation vocabulary over a server-collected, lock-aware document target contract, and external applies stay review-gated with drift-checked undo."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:208
msgid "Request a governed style apply"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:209
msgid "Queue a reviewed Global Styles or Style Book apply from a recommend-style result. Validates operations and freshness signatures, then creates a pending approval row a site administrator decides in Settings > AI Activity. Mutates nothing until approved."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:213
msgid "Request a governed template-part apply"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:214
msgid "Queue a reviewed template-part structural apply from a recommend-template-part result. Validates the proposed operations and freshness signatures, then creates a pending approval row a site administrator decides in Settings > AI Activity. Mutates nothing until approved."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:218
msgid "Request a governed template apply"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:219
msgid "Queue a reviewed page-level template structural apply from a recommend-template result. Validates the proposed operation and freshness signatures, then creates a pending approval row a site administrator decides in Settings > AI Activity. Mutates nothing until approved."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:223
msgid "Request a governed post-blocks apply"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:224
msgid "Queue a reviewed structural apply against one post or page from a recommend-post-blocks result. Validates the proposed operations and freshness signatures against the live lock-aware document contract, then creates a pending approval row a site administrator decides in Settings > AI Activity. Mutates nothing until approved."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:228
msgid "Get one AI activity entry"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:229
msgid "Return a single Flavor Agent activity entry by id, including external-apply lifecycle status, decision provenance, and undo state. The polling read for agents awaiting an approval decision."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:233
msgid "List scoped AI activity"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:234
msgid "Return Flavor Agent activity entries for one scope key with optional surface and status filters. Admin-global reads stay on the REST activity route."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:238
msgid "Undo an applied AI activity entry"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:239
msgid "Server-side undo of an executed Global Styles, Style Book, template, template-part, or post-blocks activity row: enforces ordered undo, verifies the recorded after-state still matches the live entity, restores the before snapshot, and persists the one-way undone/failed transition."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:715
msgid "Introspect block type"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:716
msgid "Return a block type's capabilities: supports, Inspector panels, attributes, styles, and variations. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:744
msgid "List allowed blocks"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:745
msgid "Return block types registered on the current site, with optional search, pagination, and variation payload controls. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:801
msgid "List block patterns"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:802
msgid "Return registered block patterns, optionally filtered by category, block type, template type, search, and payload size controls. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:860
msgid "Get block pattern"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:861
msgid "Return a single registered block pattern by name. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:889
msgid "List synced patterns"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:890
msgid "Return wp_block pattern entities available on the site, optionally filtered by sync status, search, and payload size controls. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:942
msgid "Get synced pattern"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:943
msgid "Return a single wp_block pattern entity by numeric post ID. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:971
msgid "List template parts"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:972
msgid "Return registered template-part metadata (id, slug, title, area) for editors. The id is the templatePartRef accepted by recommend-template-part. Optional content is returned only for users who can edit themes. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1018
msgid "List templates"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1019
msgid "Return registered block-template metadata (id, slug, title, description) for the active theme, with optional content only for users who can edit themes. Read-only. The id is the templateRef accepted by recommend-template."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1063
msgid "Search WordPress developer docs"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1064
msgid "Query Flavor Agent's trusted WordPress developer docs search backend. Read-only; results follow the plugin's trusted-source and currentness policy."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1163
msgid "Get active theme"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1164
msgid "Return the active theme name, stylesheet, template, and version. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1183
msgid "Get theme presets"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1184
msgid "Return the active theme design presets from global settings, including colors, typography, spacing, shadows, gradients, and duotone presets. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1203
msgid "Get theme styles"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1204
msgid "Return the applied global theme styles plus extracted element and block pseudo-state styles, along with the live Global Styles scope and context needed to call recommend-style or request-style-apply. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1223
msgid "Get theme design tokens"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1224
msgid "Return the current theme's color palette, font sizes, font families, spacing, shadows, and layout constraints. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1254
msgid "Check Flavor Agent status"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Abilities/Registration.php:1255
msgid "Report configured Flavor Agent backends, active models, and abilities currently available to the current user. Read-only diagnostic."
msgstr ""

